LeaveRequests: Employee.Department.Name Department,
    LeaveType,
    Status,
    COUNT(Id) Requests,
    SUM(Days) DaysRequested,
    ROUND(AVG(Days), <1>) AverageRequestDays,
    CountDistinct(Employee.Id) EmployeesRequesting
  Order DaysRequested DESC, Requests DESC, Department ASC, LeaveType ASC, Status ASC
  Take 10
